</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tab-pane " role="tabpanel" id="a1987169f5650053d9e3116c490d4d71-item-5"><div id="a1987169f5cd005c4e29567e30248bdb" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1987169f5d0008697eb556ffce02b41" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><p class="wb-stl-normal">JUKANYE FESTIVAL 2026 – Special Recognition Awards</p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"> </p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal">As part of the vibrant activities of JUKANYE FESTIVAL 2026, we will present Special Recognition Awards to honor individuals and groups who have significantly contributed to Africa’s liberation journey, cultural identity, and patriotic legacy. These awards include:</p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"> </p>

<ol>
<li>
<p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>Liberation Award:</strong> for African Freedom Fighters Honoring African leaders who led and sacrificed for the independence and unity of their nations.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>Mama Africa Award:</strong> for Women in Liberation and Legacy Celebrating outstanding women who contributed to Africa’s freedom and shaped its post-independence progress.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>Wisdom Award for Religious Leaders:</strong> Recognizing faith leaders who inspired courage, peace, and moral integrity during and after the liberation struggles.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>Honorary Award:</strong> for Contemporary African Patriotic LeadersAcknowledging current African leaders championing unity, Pan-Africanism, and development across the continent.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>Global Solidarity Award for Non-African Countries that Supported Africa’s Liberation</strong><br>
To honor countries outside Africa—such as Russia, China, and Cuba—that offered political, financial, or military support to African liberation movements.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>The Voice of Liberation – Music Award:</strong> Honoring musicians from Africa and around the world whose music supported Africa’s liberation movements and those who continue to promote Pan-African consciousness, patriotism, and social unity through their art.</p>
</li>
</ol>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"> </p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"><em><strong>These awards reflect the mission of JUKANYE Festival: to preserve our history, celebrate our heroes, and inspire future generations through remembrance, recognition, and cultural pride.</strong></em></p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"> </p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="a1988a48665700eb7d95dbef3b85ab5a" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988a487a2100333079bdb885d8d0e3" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>The Voice of Liberation – Music Award:</strong> </p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"> </p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal">Honoring musicians from Africa and around the world whose music supported Africa’s liberation movements and those who continue to promote Pan-African consciousness, patriotism, and social unity through their art.</p>

<p class="wb-stl-normal"> </p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="a188dd9ebc375ca308a4b0c63da230d8" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-horizontal"><div id="a188dd9ebc375d9759ceb0865d4c96d8" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-horizontal"><div id="a188dd9ebc375e3fbc6fb577b1ebe9be" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988a44d511001cf63fe9bed8e59897" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><p class="wb-stl-normal"><em><strong>These awards reflect the mission of JUKANYE Festival: to preserve our history, celebrate our heroes, and inspire future generations through remembrance, recognition, and cultural pride.</strong></em></p>
</div><div id="a1988baeb679000b80b32203847b6a93" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-horizontal"><div id="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59" class="wb_element wb-accordion wb-anim-entry wb-anim wb-anim-slide-in-left" data-plugin="Accordion" data-wb-anim-entry-time="0.6" data-wb-anim-entry-delay="0"><div class="wb-accordion-type-tabs"><div id="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-list"><ul class="nav nav-tabs" role="tablist"><li class="wb-accordion-item active" role="presentation" data-item-id="0"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-0" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-0" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1793.982" height="1793.982" viewBox="0 0 1793.982 1793.982" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; height: 1em; width: 1em; overflow: visible; direction: ltr;"><text x="1.501415" y="1537.02" font-size="1792" fill="currentColor" style='font-family: "FontAwesome"'></text></svg>&nbsp;Out of Africa – Former Era</div></a></li><li class="wb-accordion-item " role="presentation" data-item-id="1"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-1" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-1" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1793.982" height="1793.982" viewBox="0 0 1793.982 1793.982" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; height: 1em; width: 1em; overflow: visible; direction: ltr;"><text x="129.501415" y="1537.02" font-size="1792" fill="currentColor" style='font-family: "FontAwesome"'></text></svg>&nbsp;Africa – Former Era</div></a></li><li class="wb-accordion-item " role="presentation" data-item-id="2"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-2" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-2" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1793.982" height="1793.982" viewBox="0 0 1793.982 1793.982" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; height: 1em; width: 1em; overflow: visible; direction: ltr;"><text x="65.501415" y="1537.02" font-size="1792" fill="currentColor" style='font-family: "FontAwesome"'></text></svg>&nbsp;Tanzania -  Former era</div></a></li><li class="wb-accordion-item " role="presentation" data-item-id="3"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-3" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-3" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1793.982" height="1793.982" viewBox="0 0 1793.982 1793.982" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; height: 1em; width: 1em; overflow: visible; direction: ltr;"><text x="65.501415" y="1537.02" font-size="1792" fill="currentColor" style='font-family: "FontAwesome"'></text></svg>&nbsp;Out of Africa - Contemporary</div></a></li><li class="wb-accordion-item " role="presentation" data-item-id="4"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-4" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-4" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1793.982" height="1793.982" viewBox="0 0 1793.982 1793.982" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; height: 1em; width: 1em; overflow: visible; direction: ltr;"><text x="1.501415" y="1537.02" font-size="1792" fill="currentColor" style='font-family: "FontAwesome"'></text></svg>&nbsp;Africa - Contemporary</div></a></li><li class="wb-accordion-item " role="presentation" data-item-id="5"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-5" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-5" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1793.982" height="1793.982" viewBox="0 0 1793.982 1793.982" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; height: 1em; width: 1em; overflow: visible; direction: ltr;"><text x="129.501415" y="1537.02" font-size="1792" fill="currentColor" style='font-family: "FontAwesome"'></text></svg>&nbsp;Tanzania Contemporary</div></a></li><li class="wb-accordion-item " role="presentation" data-item-id="6"><a class="wb-accordion-title" href="#a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-6" aria-controls="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-6" role="tab" data-toggle="tab"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Tanzania - Traditional Music</div></a></li></ul><div class="tab-content"><div class="tab-pane active" role="tabpanel" id="a1988a48666700ae48631ef491902f59-item-0"><div id="a1988a486672008ebbd93e73d640ea5e" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988b8c46060009cf55c1c08048347b" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988a48667700959945b3bfeb3196c6" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><p class="wb-stl-normal"><strong>The Voice of Liberation Award:</strong></p>

<p>It will be awarded to musicians who fought for African freedom through art. It will recognize the contribution of music to the liberation of the African continent.</p>

<p>It will encourage today’s musicians to carry forward that legacy through their compositions</p>
</div></div></div><div id="a198708e807f003cf87e8de4581588cf" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988a9705c2000828c6a17780a75e64" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"></div></div><div id="a198708e808d00838057e062fd00cf1b" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><h3 class="wb-stl-heading3" style="text-align: center;">Music</h3>
</div><div id="a198708e809500c8248462dc899b84a1" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><p class="wb-stl-normal" style="text-align: center;">In honor of your remarkable musical legacy—amplifying the voice of Africa’s liberation, inspiring Pan-African unity, and awakening global consciousness. Your art has stood as a beacon of hope, justice, and the enduring spirit of a free and united Africa.</p>
</div></div></div><div id="a1988a94280b00787f8aa925bea310fe" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-horizontal"><div id="a1988a94280b0188d4361c225d77501f" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988a94280b023d97b36930425493c9" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"></div></div></div></div><div id="a1988aa3d47f004660bc6fa008fa4fb2" class="wb_element wb-layout-element" data-plugin="LayoutElement"><div class="wb_content wb-layout-vertical"><div id="a1988aadb9ac006db3b0285248d6444c" class="wb_element wb_element_picture" data-plugin="Picture" title=""><div class="wb_picture_wrap"><div class="wb-picture-wrapper"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/qDnPl3XNLOI"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="gallery_gen/dd0e78f584cfc0c78160781c6abc76f9_200x200_fit.jpg?ts=1785686349"></a></div></div></div><div id="a1988aad4f65005534b5d2e3189d9102" class="wb_element wb_text_element" data-plugin="TextArea" style=" line-height: normal;"><h3 class="wb-stl-custom40"><strong><a data-_="Link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=psm68xZPZTA&amp;list=RDpsm68xZPZTA&amp;start_radio=1">B</a>ob Marley</strong></h3>
